WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.659 --> 00:00:06.100
. I mentioned earlier in the program that
there was a really important milestone relating

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:10.219
to Fox News that had been achieved.

00:00:10.219 --> 00:00:12.200
And I want to talk about that now.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:17.720
For the first time ever, Newsmax TV got a
higher rating, a larger audience than Fox

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.720
News at a particular point in time.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:26.730
This has never happened before and this relates
to so many stories and issues that were following.

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:30.380
This story is about the brewing Republican
civil war.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:35.860
This story is about the growing war between
some Trump and even Trump and Fox News.

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:39.390
And this story is also about the next two
years of political media.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:45.579
Recall that Donald Trump for the last year,
but especially after the election has started

00:00:45.579 --> 00:00:47.250
going after Fox News.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:48.250
Why?

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:54.129
Because Fox News accurately reported sometimes
that Joe Biden won the election.

00:00:54.129 --> 00:00:55.129
That's it.

00:00:55.129 --> 00:00:56.129
That's what Fox News did.

00:00:56.129 --> 00:00:59.789
That has attracted the ire of the president
and many of his followers.

00:00:59.789 --> 00:01:01.440
And Trump started talking about.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:06.600
Fox is done, you got to watch Newsmax now,
you've got to watch 018 and these channels,

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:12.770
Newsmax and OMON, are so outrageous that they
actually make Fox News look slightly reasonable.

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:16.170
If you watch at certain times of day and we've
talked about how this will have an effect.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:21.410
And in fact, even at various Trump rallies
when they interview attendees and they are

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:24.120
asked, you know, even Fox News has called
this, why don't you believe it?

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:26.300
They will say Fox News is part of the left.

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:28.060
Now you have to watch.

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:29.060
And Newsmax.

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:35.420
So this is trickling down to more and more
people, this idea that Fox is now part of

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:37.290
the left.

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:40.830
And so this had a real impact in terms of
ratings as well.

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:46.350
This is just one data point, but it's the
first of its kind Monday night in what's called

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:51.360
the demo, the key demographic of 25 to 54
year old viewers.

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:57.670
Greg Kelly reports, which is a show on Newsmax,
had more viewers than the Martha MacCallum

00:01:57.670 --> 00:02:00.390
Show on Fox News at the exact same time.

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:02.340
Now, it was a really small margin.

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:06.450
Two hundred and twenty nine thousand two hundred
and three thousand, really small margin.

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:10.360
But it's still a first because prior to the
election, the numbers were not even close

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:11.750
for Newsmax ever.

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:15.560
Now, one thing that remains to be seen is
whether Newsmax grows online.

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:20.620
When Trump mentioned Newsmax, Newsmax got
a ton of YouTube subscribers, like, for example,

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:22.770
they now have one point seven million.

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:25.790
We only have one point one, almost one point
two million.

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:32.150
But in terms of views on about half the days,
we get more views on YouTube than Newsmax

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:33.440
does.

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:39.240
So just because people subscribe doesn't necessarily
mean they're consuming the content.

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:44.640
But even without knowing that this is a huge
media story, because I've often explained

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:50.650
it's not so much that it's the number of people
watching Fox News or Newsmax or listening

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:52.630
to Rush that matters.

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:59.040
It's that they set the agenda for those who
watch and that then trickles down through

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:00.920
the right wing, a sphere.

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:05.410
And with Trump in the White House, Fox News
has literally been setting the agenda.

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:08.900
Something will appear on Fox News and within
minutes, Trump tweets about it.

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:14.100
And it becomes a story for hours or for a
day or two or even four weeks in some cases.

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:19.670
So even though only a few million people might
ever see one Fox News show, it has agenda

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:20.750
setting power.

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:26.370
And that's what might change after Trump leaves
office if Trump starts giving exclusives to

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:33.170
O.J. and a Newsmax, even without huge viewership
on a Newsmax, could start agenda setting for

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:34.180
the right.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:39.610
And that, again, would be a completely humiliating
debasement of American media and culture.

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:43.520
And remember, Fox News really caught on around
the Bill Clinton impeachment.

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:46.080
Fox News started in 1996.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:51.600
And then when the Clinton impeachment took
place from 98 to ninety nine, Fox News exploded

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:54.459
and became more like what it has been recently.

00:03:54.459 --> 00:03:59.330
In the exact same way Trump's entire they
stole the election fiasco of 20/20 could be

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:04.890
what puts Newsmax and 018 in a similar position
and sort of here to stay in right wing media,

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:06.780
which is really, really scary for me.

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:10.450
It's interesting because it'll be fascinating
to cover this for the next two years.

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:12.569
But for the country, it's terrible.

00:04:12.569 --> 00:04:18.320
And the more people that are getting their
news from outlets like this, the worse off

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:18.340
the country is going to be.

